cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data, please cite the study you used (see README)."
type: dataset
title: "Astrology research data: computed answers, with scripts and CSV"
authors:
  - family-names: "Matiushenok"
    given-names: "Vladimir"
    affiliation: "StarTarot"
    website: "https://startarot.online/about"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://startarot.online/research"
repository-code: "https://github.com/StarTarotOnline/astrology-research-data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible computed studies, each with its script and CSV: how common each rising
  sign is by latitude; how often the Midheaven falls in the whole-sign 10th house; how
  often each planet is retrograde, 1900-2100; and how often each chart feature occurs
  among 95.7 million recorded births in Brazil, Japan and the USA.
keywords:
  - astrology
  - astronomy
  - ephemeris
  - ascendant
  - retrograde
  - birth time
  - dataset
